{
  "comment": "Furiah's Visuals: the butterfly knife's own clips (its swings and guard are the knife set's). The safe handle stays in the fist; parts: blade turns about its pin on the safe handle, handle_b (the bite handle) rides on the blade and turns about the blade's other pin. Open is 0, 0; closed is blade -180, handle_b -180. Closing: the blade swings clockwise over the right while the bite handle goes round the left, then the bite handle swings down over the right; opening is the same backwards, so the handles never meet. The flips play facing you (the knife's flat toward the camera), the wrist flicking with each swing. Every clip here is original to this mod.",
